{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922134753_dac9bd5f","chunk_index":6,"job_id":"mwjob_012cb0598553aad7bb5d99d3","precondition_digest":"c0b359476f04d3b8f63197b60167afce3392f38065448042867a9942faf64dd5","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_786ed871c599f48b","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7e45f89bd422b0c","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_4c48871b5365c1fd","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_7a3cc05f07007ef0"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922134753_dac9bd5f","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_def_inclusion"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:272555d9fdd4cf27292dc806","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_786ed871c599f48b\n章节编号=5.3\n章节标题=入选标准\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"7eff6fd6d45919f8fca3134df509513a548f279c06d2aa5e3a8b53ec9ac19ec5","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:272555d9fdd4cf27292dc806","span_id":"es_sel_inclusion"}],"evidence_span_ids":["es_def_inclusion","es_sel_inclusion"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[],"heading":"入选标准","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"受试者须满足以下全部条件方可入选本研究：年龄不低于18岁；确诊为斑块状银屑病，且病程不少于6个月；在筛选期及基线时，银屑病面积和严重程度指数（PASI）评分不低于12、受累体表面积不低于10%、静态医师总体评估（sPGA）评分不低于3；研究者判断受试者适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","rationale":"依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的入选标准模块撰写，年龄、病程、PASI、受累体表面积、sPGA阈值及适合接受系统治疗或光疗均直接来自该来源。医学作者需复核疾病严重程度评价的操作性定义、评估时点和原始记录要求。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（入选标准）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_786ed871c599f48b","section_number":"5.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:272555d9fdd4cf27292dc806","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922134753_dac9bd5f","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"25de1577631d408629fd83338122249e7d0333f30cafbcf4445c1c9991fc6aee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_def_exclusion"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:272555d9fdd4cf27292dc806","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7e45f89bd422b0c\n章节编号=5.4\n章节标题=排除标准\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"2b1ce2b87be7dd4e40cbc052abe90b22d8a03147b391d77d20801da394160d8f","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:272555d9fdd4cf27292dc806","span_id":"es_sel_exclusion"}],"evidence_span_ids":["es_def_exclusion","es_sel_exclusion"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[],"heading":"排除标准","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"符合以下任一情形的受试者不得进入本研究：以非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效或安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；存在活动性严重感染；处于妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加本研究。","rationale":"依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的排除标准模块撰写。妊娠或哺乳仅为排除条件，来源未给出避孕方法、妊娠检查、伴侣妊娠报告或随访安排，正文未扩展相关规则。医学作者需复核活动性严重感染及研究者判断的记录要求。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（排除标准）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7e45f89bd422b0c","section_number":"5.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selec