_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_def_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"6e161fdc710a0a80dfd37e8087ba89849d7bfdb2aa6b1f8d9a2466c304e8fae9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_def_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_def_control"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_def_route"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_def_form"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"es_def_tech"}],"evidence_span_ids":["es_def_treatment","es_def_dose","es_def_placebo","es_def_control","es_def_route","es_def_form","es_def_tech"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":7},"gap_items":[{"action":"需补充试验药包装、标签、储存条件、发放与回收的项目文件后纳入本节。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_imp_packaging","missing_source_classes":["试验药包装、标签、储存与分发回收操作文件/项目来源"],"target":"第6节 研究治疗/干预——试验药包装、标签、储存、发放与回收"},{"action":"需补充剂量调整、暂停、恢复或永久停药的项目规则来源后纳入本节。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_imp_dose_mod","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整、暂停、恢复或永久停药项目文件"],"target":"第6节 研究治疗/干预——剂量调整、暂停、恢复或永久停药"},{"action":"需补充合并用药、禁限用药与救援治疗的项目规则来源后纳入本节。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_imp_conmed","missing_source_classes":["合并用药、禁限用药与救援治疗项目来源"],"target":"第6节 研究治疗/干预——合并用药、禁限用药与救援治疗"}],"heading":"研究治疗/干预","missing_source_classes":["试验药包装、标签、储存与分发回收操作文件/项目来源","剂量调整、暂停、恢复或永久停药项目文件","合并用药、禁限用药与救援治疗项目来源"],"proposal_text":"本研究的试验干预为合成试验药A，属于小分子药物，剂型为口服固体制剂，经口服给药。试验组受试者接受合成试验药A 100 mg，每日一次，自第1天至第16周连续给药；对照组受试者接受匹配安慰剂，每日一次，自第1天至第16周双盲治疗期给药。试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。受试者依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。","rationale":"依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的试验干预、剂量与给药方案、匹配安慰剂、1:1随机、双盲治疗16周、口服给药、口服固体制剂、小分子技术类型及依从性评价撰写。包装、标签、储存、发放与回收、剂量调整或暂停恢复规则及合并用药规则未在来源中确认，未写入正文并列入缺口；医学作者需复核盲法实施和依从性记录方式。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_7a3cc05f07007ef0","section_number":"6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:272555d9fdd4cf27292dc806","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"399573590b664fd9f8dbf4c77324f833c1c99888b566fdc7e495fa7afc98bd88","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:272555d9fdd4cf27292dc806","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:272555d9fdd4cf27292dc806","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:c0b359476f04d3b8f63197b60167afce3392f38065448042867a9942faf64dd5:272555d9fdd4cf27292dc806","text_sha256":"399573590b664fd9f8dbf4c77324f833c1c99888b566fdc7e495fa7afc98bd88"},{"content_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da